Joint Reaction Loads
version=1
nRows=217
nColumns=199
inDegrees=no

This file contains the reaction forces and moments
applied to the specified body of a joint pair and expressed  in the specified reference frame.

Units are S.I. units (seconds, meters, Newtons, ...)
